   "widgets_values": [
    "Full character RefMod \u2014 images + a short video + a voice clip in one bundle.\n\nMODELS (ComfyUI/models/vae/) \u2014 extraction needs the two VAEs and nothing\nelse; no 29B DiT, no CLIP:\n    minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n    your MiniMax-H3 audio VAE\n\nSOURCES: put 8-20 images of the character AND one short clip (5-10 s,\nmp4/webm/mov/mkv) in  ComfyUI/input/character_ref/  \u2014 the folder loader\ntakes images first, then videos, so one folder feeds both. The creation\nguide's mix works best: ~40% front, 30% three-quarter, 20% profile,\n10% full body. Video decoding needs no extra install (ComfyUI ships\nPyAV); opencv-python or imageio are used first when present.\nDrop the voice clip into ComfyUI/input/ and pick it in LoadAudio.\n\nQUEUE: you get ONE file \u2014 models/refmods/my_character.safetensors \u2014 holding\nthe visual reference and the voice (save_layout = bundle).\n\nCHECK: Inspect decodes the stored latent and the stored audio back, so you\ncan see and hear what was captured before spending GPU time on generation.\n\nUSE IT: add a Load H3 RefMods node, press R to refresh its list, pick\nmy_character, and chain Apply H3 RefMod into your sampler \u2014 the wiring is\nin examples/workflows/refmod_identity_video.json."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
